      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would be more than happy to do just that. :-) The reason I added this flag is that I cannot guarantee that removing runtime invisible annotations does not change runtime behavior. To the best of my knowledge, there is no way to lookup runtime invisible annotations using reflection, but who knows what the runtime might be doing. For example, we have the `dalvik.annotation.optimization` annotations, which are runtime invisible but should not be removed. These should be retained by R8 even when the configuration does not specify to keep runtime invisible annotations, however.",
